# Release-signing PRIVATE key material must never live in this repo -- only
# release-signing-pubkey.pem (the public half) belongs here. This is a safety net,
# not the actual safeguard: the real private key should never be created anywhere
# under this directory in the first place.
*.PRIVATE.pem
release-signing-key.pem
